er 8, 2025, the Company closed another public offering (the “September 2025 Public Offering”) of 53,571 units (the “Units”) at a public offering price of $112.00 per Unit, with each Unit consisting of: (i) one Class A Ordinary Share (the “Class A Shares”); (ii) one Series A Warrant to purchase one Class A Share (the “Series A Warrants”); (iii) one Series B Warrant to purchase such number of Class A Shares as determined in the Series B Warrant (the “Series B Warrants” and together with the Series A Warrants, the “Warrants”).","context":"September 2025 Public Offering","section":"","block":418,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-040322","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-27","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001964946","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1964946/000149315226040322/ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/a9b2824247bc11170fe64c981b9d5ade10a214e309549425781f1e45c802bbe4.bin","sha256":"a9b2824247bc11170fe64c981b9d5ade10a214e309549425781f1e45c802bbe4"}},{"id":"60bcffcd47eb313bd8dbe9161cdd7912178cbf3fbd6c9908b30526cf8ac58ae2","quote":"On April 21, 2026, the Company entered into a share purchase agreement with certain shareholders of YATOP Group Limited (“YATOP”) to acquire an 18% equity interest in YATOP for total consideration of approximately $10.8 million, which was satisfied through the issuance of the Company’s Class A ordinary shares. The transaction was completed on May 7, 2026, and the Company issued 2,220,166 Class A ordinary shares to the selling shareholders as consideration for the acquisition.","context":"Investment to YATOP","section":"","block":479,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-040322","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-27","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001964946","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1964946/0001